      <Layer queryable="1" opaque="0">
        <Name>eos04_soil_moisture</Name>
        <Title>EOS-04 (RISAT-1A) SAR-MRS Surface Soil Moisture, 500 m</Title>
        <Abstract>Volumetric surface soil moisture (m3/m3) at ~500 m from ISRO's EOS-04 C-band SAR (MRS mode) combined with SMAP L-band radiometer data (active-passive algorithm, SAC/ISRO ATBD Dec 2023). Source products: Bhoonidhi STAC collection EOS-04_SAR-MRS_SM (NRSC). Each TIME value is one acquisition date; the 17-day EOS-04 repeat cycle means a given location is observed about every 17 days. ATBD range 0.02-0.65 m3/m3 (some delivered values exceed 0.65); nodata = -9999. Band 1, EPSG:4326, 0.005 deg grid, nearest-neighbour preparation.</Abstract>
